<title>NETHERLANDS: HOLEC HOLLAND LIFTS H1 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>HOLEC HOLLAND LIFTS H1 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
